袖不知寒，春在歌喉暖响间。\n我辈年来要陶写，好将西野作东山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11005,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"苏彦良西野堂","author":"许有壬","text":"苍苔满径树连村，中有幽人屐齿痕。\n此去客来宜定约，无诗无酒不开门。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11006,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"苏彦良西野堂四绝 其四","author":"许有壬","text":"筑堂西野事西畴，桃杏才春麦又秋。\n慎勿下堂东向望，禺商毫末拂牙筹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11007,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"安平孙茂实九十八不衰诸公有诗贺其高年耆德","author":"许有壬","text":"九十八年犹矍铄，百千万事任浮沈。\n郊原杖屦亲朋酒，此是期颐未了心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11008,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题对镜写真图用滕玉霄韵","author":"许有壬","text":"镜中几上共三人，为问先生孰是真。\n自古圣贤皆不死，楮生何足托吾身。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11009,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题千叶桃图","author":"许有壬","text":"五出凡花一扫空，万重千叠裹春风。\n连昌有竹堪为侣，底事墙头簌簌红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11010,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"败荷鹭鸶扇面","author":"许有壬","text":"苇折荷枯水有声，野塘斜日影伶俜。\n鹓鸾班里忽飞去，点破西山一段青。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11011,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题和叔扇头时坐登瀛楼","author":"许有壬","text":"楼居高出白云间，不为求仙只为山。\n领取烟岚无限景，天教吾与子俱閒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11012,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天宁方丈题和叔扇头","author":"许有壬","text":"凉飙深殿度飕飕，老柏疏篁已报秋。\n弱水波涛三万里，人间自有小瀛洲。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11013,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"陪明初行独乐台溪边得口号","author":"许有壬","text":"寒波清浅带霜流，不到溪边不见秋。\n叠嶂层崖三百转，树梢擎出月如钩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11014,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次白公严韵谢其寄酒与柑","author":"许有壬","text":"任城绿醑侑黄柑，远寄山中岂所堪。\n香雾噀人醒易解，不教飞梦到江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11015,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题弄花香满衣图","author":"许有壬","text":"冰绡桂襡缕金裙，浮动红芳乱綵云。\n捲却六铢春沁骨，荀郎无复事炉熏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":11016,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"理宗书金丹诗 其一","author":"许有壬","text":"常笑秦皇与汉皇，一生徒梦白云乡。\n东南蕞尔垂亡国，犹说金丹事渺茫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe